    "unique_elements": {
      "nonstandard_elements": "A 'Void' described as completely dark with no light yet profoundly peaceful; sense of being held by a loving hand of the Creator; many souls suspended and silent; return precipitated by hearing a sound that became her name; intense mechanical/screw-like pain on re-entering body; immediate recovery from illness; days of anger toward others for bringing her back.",
      "notable_quotes": "“In the void, there isn't any light. It is completely dark but you know while you are there that you are being held by a very loving (seemed like) hand of the creator.”; “There was also a great many souls in there; each of them suspended and silent…”; “The sound grew to become my name and I knew should I listen to the voice calling my name; I would have to return to my body.”; “When I re-entered my body it was the worse pain I ever experienced. It felt like what a screw might have felt while it was screwed into wood.”; “I was no longer ill.”; “I knew it was a very real experience.”"
